":"Sep 2017 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c82d39ef-c078-4802-841a-e99285884afc.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2017-05-01","title":"May 2017 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8c3bab44-cc46-4d9b-957b-629931e78e57.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2017-02-01","title":"Feb 2017 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=F5E8CCF2_AEA8_4949_90F7_1AC5DFE66D39_181714.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2026","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/8c85b761-c333-48e7-bafe-a8c351594300.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/b15cd42f-7128-464e-b21c-1997c0ccb9f2.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/e5be1b0c-b2c4-4f08-b86f-b622fabd7b48.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/1c6436c0-7ca7-4f67-94ce-9e869edebbec.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/73374532796.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/69375532796_16_08_21.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532796/5327960312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Lumax Auto Technologies Limited released its investor presentation for the second quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026, reporting a consolidated Q2FY27 revenue of INR 1,556 Cr and PAT of INR 117 Cr. Management highlighted strategic priorities around the Tier-0.5 transition, premiumisation, clean mobility, and expanding manufacturing and R&D footprints. The company also showcased its order book of INR 1,879 Cr, robust segment-wise operational performance, and key awards received from major OEM customers. Lumax Auto Technologies reported a strong start to FY 27, with Q1 revenue growing 33% year-on-year to INR 1,364 crore and EBITDA up 51% to INR 205 crore. Management highlighted a robust order book of INR 1,600 crore and outlined ongoing expansion projects including a new Mechatronics plant in Manesar and a new Greenfuel facility in Nashik.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The full year capex guidance continues to remain around INR 300 crore.","quote":"The guidance for the full year continues to remain around INR 300 crore, which will include the upcoming greenfield expansions of Mechatronics as well as new plants of IAC division.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"Management states that the company will be able to sustain current margins achieved in Q1 for the remaining part of the year.","quote":"On the margin front, I think I can only say that we will be able to sustain these current margins achieved in Q1 for the remaining part of the year as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains its long-term 20% revenue CAGR vision from 2025 to 2031.","quote":"In the long term, our compass remains our “20.20.20.20 Vision”, aiming for a 20% revenue CAGR from 2025 to 2031, inching closer to 20% EBITDA margin over the next 5 to 7 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"Management remains confident in posting double-digit growth for the remaining part of the year in the Aftermarket segment.","quote":"However, we are confident to bounce back and confident to post double-digit growth for the remaining part of the year in this particular segment.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The company targets a minimum revenue CAGR of 20% for the FY26-FY31 mid-term plan.","quote":"20% CAGR (Minimum) in Revenue","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=66ac21bb-5dc9-4b2b-a59f-e91debf39767.pdf"},{"claim":"The vision for EBITDA margin is set at 20%.","quote":"20% Vision for EBITDA Margin","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=66ac21bb-5dc9-4b2b-a59f-e91debf39767.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"As the industry enters the festive season, demand is expected to remain healthy with low inventory levels reported by leading OEMs.","quote":"As we enter the festive season, demand is expected to remain healthy, with many leading OEMs (Original Equipment Manufacturers) reporting low inventory levels.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The overall demand environment and industry outlook continues to be favorable.","quote":"While we remain watchful of the macroeconomic uncertainties, commodity inflation and the energy price volatility, the overall demand environment and industry outlook continues to be favorable, giving us confidence for the near term.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The Advanced Plastics IAC Plant in Chakan has a timeline of Q4 FY27.","quote":"Timeline Q4 FY27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8ef8a9ff-c5ab-404e-9313-1918365547f1.pdf"},{"claim":"A new plant is being set up at Chakan for the IAC division to cater to upcoming demand from Mahindra & Mahindra.","quote":"• A new plant at Chakan for the IAC division to cater to upcoming demand from Mahindra & Mahindra, while simultaneously optimizing product lines between this facility and the existing ones.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The mega Mechatronics plant in Manesar is expected to be commissioned by Q3 of the year.","quote":"• The previously announced mega Mechatronics plant in Manesar, Haryana is expected to be commissioned by Q3 of this year, where we are consolidating four entities, Lumax Yokowo, Lumax Alps Alpine, Lumax Ituran and Lumax FAE, under one roof to optimize resources and fixed costs.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"A new facility will be set up in Nashik to cater to Mahindra's requirements for Greenfuel Energy.","quote":"• At Greenfuel Energy, we are pleased to report that we onboarded Mahindra as a new customer and to cater to their requirements, we shall be setting up a new facility in Nashik.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"Capex during the first quarter stood at INR 23 crore.","quote":"The capex during the 1st Quarter was INR 23 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The company reported a capex of INR 23 Cr for Q1 FY27.","quote":"Capex: Q1 FY27 INR 23 Cr","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=66ac21bb-5dc9-4b2b-a59f-e91debf39767.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"The effective tax rate continues to remain around 25%.","quote":"The effective tax rate continues to remain at around 25%, which is also expected to hold at similar levels way forward.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"Greenfuel division experienced a one-off tooling revenue impact of around INR 3 crore on EBITDA margins.","quote":"Mihir Ji, there was an amount of around INR 3-odd crore specifically for this particular Greenfuel division impacting around 3% on the EBITDA margins, which was one-off as a result of certain tooling revenue, which happened with the existing customer.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The total order book stands at INR 1,879 Cr, to be executed through FY29.","quote":"INR 1,879 Cr Total Order Book","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8ef8a9ff-c5ab-404e-9313-1918365547f1.pdf"},{"claim":"The company reported an order book of INR 1,600 crore.","quote":"We are pleased to report a robust order book of INR 1,600 crore, which provides a healthy visibility for the business going forward.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"Approximately 24% of the order book is expected to be executed in FY 27, 56% in FY 28, and 20% in FY 29.","quote":"Of this order book, approximately 24% is expected to be executed in this FY 27 itself, 56% in FY 28, and the remaining 20% in FY 29.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The Advanced Plastics division has an order book of INR 787 crore.","quote":"The order book remains strong at INR 787 crore for this division, providing solid future visibility.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The Mechatronics segment has an order book close to INR 500 crore.","quote":"The Mechatronics segment sustained its upward momentum, delivering a y-o-y increase of almost 56% in Q1 FY 27 from INR 54 to INR 84 crore, with a very healthy order book of close to INR 500 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The Structure and Control Systems vertical reported an order book of INR 130 crore.","quote":"It reported a y-o-y growth of 21% in Q1, increasing from INR 180 crore to INR 220 crore with an order book of INR 130 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The Alternate Fuels business reported an order book of INR 200 crore.","quote":"The Alternate Fuels business showed a growth of 17% y-o-y from INR 95 to INR 111 crore with an order book of INR 200 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The order book is scheduled to progress in stages to achieve full completion by FY29.","quote":"The order book is set to progress in stages achieving full completion by FY29.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=66ac21bb-5dc9-4b2b-a59f-e91debf39767.pdf"},{"claim":"The company operates 28 manufacturing facilities across 7 states in India.","quote":"28 Plants in 7 States","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=66ac21bb-5dc9-4b2b-a59f-e91debf39767.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Free cash reserves stood at INR 415 crore as of June 2026.","quote":"Free cash reserves stood at INR 415 crore, providing us with the financial flexibility to support ongoing investments and navigate market cycles confidently.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"Long-term debt stood at INR 508 crore, resulting in a debt-to-equity ratio of 0.32.","quote":"The long-term debt stood at INR 508 crore, resulting in a conservative debt-to-equity ratio of 0.32, which is within our internal comfort thresholds.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The majority of the INR 300 crore capex will continue to be funded from internal accruals.","quote":"The majority of the capex, INR 300 crore, will continue to fund from the internal accruals.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The global economy continues to navigate a challenging geopolitical landscape with conflict in the Middle East raising concerns.","quote":"The global economy continues to navigate a challenging geopolitical landscape with the ongoing conflict in the Middle East, heightening concerns around energy security, supply chain disruptions, and inflationary pressures.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"},{"claim":"The industry continues to closely monitor commodity prices, geopolitical developments, and supply chain dynamics.","quote":"The industry continues to closely monitor commodity prices, geopolitical developments and supply chain dynamics that could influence input costs and overall market sentiment.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company targets reaching approximately INR 11,000 Cr in revenue by FY31.","quote":"INR 3,637 Cr ➜ ~INR 11,000 Cr","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8ef8a9ff-c5ab-404e-9313-1918365547f1.pdf","timeframe":"FY31"},{"claim":"Management targets an EBITDA of approximately INR 1,000 Cr by FY28.","quote":"INR 500 Cr ➜ ~INR 1,000 Cr","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8ef8a9ff-c5ab-404e-9313-1918365547f1.pdf","timeframe":"FY28"},{"claim":"The company aspires to double its current revenue base to upwards of INR 10,000 crore by FY 2031.","quote":"And by FY 2031, we aspire to more than double our current revenue base to upwards of INR 10,000 crore, fueled by a blend of organic excellence and strategically inorganic opportunities.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The effective tax rate is expected to hold at around 25% going forward.","quote":"The effective tax rate continues to remain at around 25%, which is also expected to hold at similar levels way forward.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The Mechatronics vertical targets operating at an EBITDA margin between 14-15% over the next 12-24 months.","quote":"the intended path is that over the next 12-24 months, the Mechatronics basket will be operating in anywhere between 14-15% EBITDA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"The Mechatronics division targets reaching close to INR 1,000 crore top line by FY 2030-31.","quote":"I think, to me, by FY 2030-31, we should definitely be looking at close to INR 1,000 crore top line from Mechatronics division.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=94022f8c-237d-4839-b78c-dde8181e44c8.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management established a mid-term plan for FY26-FY31 aimed at achieving specific financial and operational milestones.","quote":"Next Mid term Plan (FY26 – FY31)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=66ac21bb-5dc9-4b2b-a59f-e91debf39767.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":37,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":22,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}